  "bodyHash": "eeAuWpqZ+hQ=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。滿懷愛意製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「磨刀石銳利工具」是一款極簡風格的模組，新增了讓磨刀石能夠暫時提升放置其上工具傷害的能力。</span> <br><br></p><p>透過在磨刀石上<strong>蹲下+滑鼠右鍵</strong>任何工具來磨利它。這會賦予該工具 <strong>N</strong> 次磨利使用次數（可在設定檔中定義）。</p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective 模組\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience 模組包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 組合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>usesAfterGrinding</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 32，最小值 1，最大值 5000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;工具在磨刀石上使用後獲得的磨利使用次數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sharpenedDamageModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1.5，最小值 0，最大值 100.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;磨利工具的傷害加成倍數。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendUsesLeftInChat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;在剩餘使用次數達 75%、50%、25%、10% 時傳送訊息給磨利工具的使用者。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showUsesLeftInItemName</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;在物品名稱中顯示剩餘使用次數。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameUsesPrefix</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 \"(磨利次數：\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;工具名稱中顯示磨利剩餘使用次數的前綴。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameUsesSuffix</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 =&nbsp; \")\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;工具名稱中顯示磨利剩餘使用次數的後綴。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><strong>對磨刀石蹲下 + 滑鼠右鍵，且手中持有工具：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/a.jpg\" alt=\"0\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong><br><br><strong>這會磨利該工具，並依照設定將其資訊加入物品名稱中。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"684\" height=\"281\"></strong><br><br><strong>攻擊任何實體時，傷害會根據設定檔中的加成倍數增加：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"664\"></strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也能設定在聊天欄中顯示剩餘使用次數：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"137\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由將此模組用於任何模組包中，只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面上追蹤留言，因此留言功能已關閉。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 存放庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
